Here is the modified sequence of client requests with the NOOP and MKD commands added in appropriate locations:

```
USER anonymous
PASS ubuntu
SYST
NOOP
PWD
PORT 127,0,0,1,152,193
MKD new_directory
LIST
QUIT
```

In this modified sequence, the NOOP command is added after the SYST command, and the MKD command is added before the LIST command to create a new directory before listing its contents

